{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Hey John! Long time no chat - I adopted a pup from a shelter in Stamford last week and my days have been so much happier with him in the fam. I named it Ned. Any progress on your gaming goals?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_5-62cd782a896bc44779825ad7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:47:04.940414+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "62cd782a896bc44779825ad7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "62cd782a896bc44779825ad7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey James! Congrats on getting a pup! They really do make days brighter. I haven't made much progress with gaming lately, life's been busy with work and stuff but it's always nice to remember how happy gaming makes me. It's a good way to forget the stresses of life."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_5-e9b325fe5ac2165b01c964b3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:47:04.971714+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e9b325fe5ac2165b01c964b3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e9b325fe5ac2165b01c964b3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Thanks, John! Gaming really does help forget about the stresses of life. It's like heading into another world! Have you played any interesting games lately?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_5-b8eb9949467cf083b9031fbc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:47:04.996943+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b8eb9949467cf083b9031fbc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b8eb9949467cf083b9031fbc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I'm playing this new RPG that has a really cool story and world. It's kinda like getting transported to a futuristic dystopia."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_5-eb5e476ad8c847df7a41c828", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:47:05.013397+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "eb5e476ad8c847df7a41c828", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "eb5e476ad8c847df7a41c828", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Sounds great! Will I like it? I'm always up for trying new games."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_5-c961725a8c3dacf899a76e3b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:47:05.034214+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c961725a8c3dacf899a76e3b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c961725a8c3dacf899a76e3b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: You'll love it! It has a fun story and an awesome world. Plus, it has some tough gameplay. However, the game is a little laggy and sometimes produces errors. Here is one of them that I came across yesterday."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_5-720930e3c04e48877941318c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:47:05.050418+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "720930e3c04e48877941318c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "720930e3c04e48877941318c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: The game must still be raw. I'd rather wait until the bugs are completely fixed, and then I'll try it out."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_5-e3dcb18793e3f44ff271755f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:47:05.069240+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e3dcb18793e3f44ff271755f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e3dcb18793e3f44ff271755f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Even with minor bugs, the game still looks great. The graphics are awesome and the gameplay is super immersive. I'm sure you should try it out now. I can send you a link."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_5-78e99651cd8561a5582fbd0d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:47:05.086108+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "78e99651cd8561a5582fbd0d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "78e99651cd8561a5582fbd0d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Okay, you convinced me. Well, I'll wait for the link then, thanks!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_5-b76118d54d4897ed477534f7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:47:05.103649+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b76118d54d4897ed477534f7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b76118d54d4897ed477534f7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Cool, I'll send it to you. Let me know what you think after you check it out!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_5-b766cf98b0f0be0b5c535a60", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:47:05.117521+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b766cf98b0f0be0b5c535a60", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b766cf98b0f0be0b5c535a60", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Cool, John! I'll check it out and let you know what I think. I'm excited to give it a try."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_5-4bf3d093a4faa26437ecd0a1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:47:05.143004+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4bf3d093a4faa26437ecd0a1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4bf3d093a4faa26437ecd0a1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, James! Excited to hear your thoughts. Have a great time!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_5-965927ecb4233fa3e3a58b25", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:47:05.161474+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "965927ecb4233fa3e3a58b25", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "965927ecb4233fa3e3a58b25", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Cheers! Will do. Enjoy the gaming! Bye!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_5-ed8562f36f3d80a492fb3714", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:47:05.179882+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ed8562f36f3d80a492fb3714", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ed8562f36f3d80a492fb3714", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Bye for now!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_5-f9876120c9418fa9157a433d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:47:05.195164+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f9876120c9418fa9157a433d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f9876120c9418fa9157a433d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: See ya! Take care!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_5-e4afc6be5981ea712f1ddb1e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:47:05.209000+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e4afc6be5981ea712f1ddb1e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e4afc6be5981ea712f1ddb1e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Take care!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_5-b3231c99207e4bdb360499bb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:47:05.226064+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b3231c99207e4bdb360499bb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b3231c99207e4bdb360499bb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
